// DEAD-LEVER REPAIR (stage 2 audit rule TRANSONIC).  Without this entry, setting
    // `transonic yes` in fvSolution aborts at the first pressure solve on
    //   Entry 'div(phid,p)' not found in dictionary "system/fvSchemes/divSchemes"
    // because `default none;` makes an unruled term a hard abort.  On this case that
    // is exactly what happened: the diagnostic registered to TEST the transonic
    // switch died in dictionary lookup at Time = 1 having exercised nothing, and the
    // record then carried a rung as tried that was never once pulled.
    div(phid,p)                                   Gauss upwind;
